TO : ALL CONCERNED

FM : PUSBE


Good day.

We would inform you of PUSBS has succeeded in attracting Renault's 2014 shi=
pment from KRPUS to MYPKG with VLCBB.

In order to keep making good biz relationship with Renault and Renault Sams=
ung, please refer to below details about this business.


=3D Details =3D

1. Shipper: Renault Samsung Motors

2. Item: Auto parts with dangerous cargo(Batteries, Airbag Inflators and Se=
atbelt pretensioner)

3. POL/POD: KRPUS/MYPKG

4. Vol: 1009 Teu / Year

On top of that, Renault has held 2014 bidding both in France and Japan for =
their 310,000 Teus shipment,

which each POL sales office should be updated with sufficient information i=
n timely manner so that HJS can attract this business as much as we can.


In this sense, we request you to check out status of Renault's 2014 bidding=
 and share it with each sales office in timely manner as

Renault Samsung in Korea requested PUSBS to make a presentation for KRPUS-M=
YPKG business last June.

This means a sales represantative has to prepare and make a presentation wh=
en each Renault office requests it if HJS is nominated one of finalist.


Furthermore, it is recommendable for each sales office to check out suitabl=
e lanes for Renault's shipment

due to the fact that their cargos contain Airbag Inflators and Seatbelt pre=
tensioner(UNNO 3268, CLASS 9)

which is under severe restriction in SGSIN for its transshipment.


It is expected that this business can contribute to HJS' 2014 profit, and w=
e hope everyone's keen attention on 2014 bidding.





